  "title": "Red Cat (RCAT) Receives Air Force Order and Validates New Drone Capabilities",
  "summary": "Red Cat’s Teal Drones subsidiary received a $2.49 million firm-fixed-price contract from the U.S. Air Force Security Forces Center for Black Widow unmanned aircraft, training, batteries, spares and related support.The systems will be used in a technical and operational assessment of Black Widow as a potential successor to the Air Force Security Forces’ existing Teal 2 fleet. Delivery is scheduled by August 24, 2026.Black Widow | Modularity for the WarfighterThe immediate contract value is modest",
